<title>USA: Strong storm heads for west, southern Britain - WSC.</title>
<headline>Strong storm heads for west, southern Britain - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A strong storm system will move across the west and south British Isles during Tuesday, private forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>This could make for some rough seas and strong winds from the Atlantic across the English Channel during that time, and shipping may be affected, it said.</p>
